<h2 id=3D"intuition">Intuition</h2>
<p>A straightforward approach is to iterate through the linked list while k=
eeping track of the nodes that were already visited in a hash set. Encounte=
ring a previously-visited node during the traversal indicates the presence =
of a cycle. Below is the code snippet for this approach:</p>
